  "2D Dynamics": "Whether the motion on screen matches: moving-object overlap (all scenes), plus optical flow and point tracks (real videos).",
  "2.5D Geometry": "Depth error against the reference (real videos).",
  "3D Geometry": "How close the reconstructed surfaces are to the true ones (simulated scenes).",
  "3D Dynamics": "Whether matter follows its true 3D motion (simulated scenes)."
